@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam padding 2
skinparam dpi 160
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 360
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam sequenceMessageFontSize 15
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontSize 15
skinparam sequencePadding 2
actor 旅客 as U
participant "Dashboard.vue\n创建区 / 仪表盘" as V
participant "persistedJourney.ts\n本机记录" as P
participant "useJourneyStore()\n快照状态" as J
participant "api/journey.ts\n接口封装" as API
V -> V : onMounted → restoreJourney()
V -> P : loadSavedJourney()
P --> V : saved（可为 null）
alt 首次使用或本机无记录
 V -> V : return；显示创建区
 U -> V : 填写表单并点击开始分析
 V -> V : submit() / validate() / buildPayload()
 V -> API : createJourney(payload)
 API --> V : accepted.journeyId
 V -> P : saveJourney(id, payload)
 V -> V : journeyId = id
else 打开时本机存在记录
 V -> V : form = saved.payload
 note over V,J
 优先加载已保存 ID；加载失败时，
 按 saved.payload 重新创建并保存新 ID。
 end note
end
V -> J : load(id)
J -> API : getState(id)
API --> J : 当前 snapshot
J -> API : createStream(id, apply)
API -> J : snapshot 事件 → apply(next)
J --> V : snapshot 更新；ready 时更新 lastReady
V -> V : restore 分支加载成功后设置 journeyId；渲染 display
ref over V,API : failed 时点击 retry()：重新创建、保存并 load 新行程
opt 点击删除行程
 U -> V : removeJourney()
 V -> P : clearSavedJourney()
 V -> J : reset()
 V -> V : journeyId = null → 返回创建区
end
note over V,J : 同一 Dashboard.vue 内切换条件分支，没有额外页面路由。

@enduml
